SUMMARY:Plant Bingo at Green River Brewing & Taproom
DESCRIPTION:🌿 A lot of bingo. A lot of plants. Fun for the whole family. \nJoin us at Green River Brewing & Taproom in Winters for two hours of Plant Bingo! Bring your friends\, bring the kids\, and bring your dog—this is a family-friendly\, dog-friendly night out. \nGrab something delicious\, settle in\, and get ready for round after round of bingo with beautiful houseplants up for grabs. No bingo experience or green thumb required—we’ll explain each game as we go! \n🎟️ Your admission includes: \n\n8 rounds of bingo play\nChances to win beautiful plants throughout the evening\nFun plant facts and simple care tips to help your greenery thrive\nA guaranteed small plant to take home—even if you never shout “Bingo!”\n\nWant more chances to win? Extra bingo cards are available as optional add-ons. Each player needs an admission ticket; extra cards alone do not include admission. \n📅 Wednesday\, December 2\, 2026\n🕕 Plant Bingo: 6–8 PM\n📍 Green River Brewing & Taproom\n4513 Putah Creek Road\, Winters\, CA \nCome early to get settled and order before the first round. Food and beverages are available for separate purchase from the venue. \nMake a night of it with your favorite people—and leave with a little more greenery. 🌱
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/plant-bingo-at-green-river-brewing-taproom/
LOCATION:Green River Brewery\, 513 Putah Creek Rd\, Winters\, CA\, 95694\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Green_River_Plant_Bingo_Under_512KB.jpg
END:VEVENT
