SUMMARY:Davis Candlelight Parade\, Tree Lighting and Winter Wonderland
DESCRIPTION:The City of Davis invites the community to attend the 45th annual Candlelight Parade\, Community Tree Lighting and Winter Wonderland celebration on Thursday\, Dec. 3\, from 6-8 p.m. \nSanta and Mrs. Claus are returning this year to lead the Candlelight Parade\, which will start promptly at 6 p.m.\, from the Davis Food Co-op parking lot (620 G Street) and conclude at the E Street Plaza. Families and residents of all ages interested in participating in the Parade should arrive before 5:45 p.m. in the Co-op parking lot. Parade parking will not be available in the Food Co-op parking lot. Rolling street closures will be occurring for the parade through downtown Davis\, including at Fifth Street. As a result\, drivers in this area should expect delays up to 20 minutes from 6-6:30 p.m. \nOnce the parade arrives at the E Street Plaza\, there will be a countdown for the lighting of the community tree led by the Davis City Council at 6:30 p.m. After the tree lighting\, everyone is encouraged to head over to G Street\, between Second and Third Streets\, for musical performances\, snow fall\, activities showcasing the diversity of the season led by a local nonprofit\, photos with Santa on the antique fire engine and more. \nAdditional activities include: \n\nFree horse and carriage rides at G Street\, sponsored by City of Davis employee groups\, PASEA\, DPOA\, Local 3494 and DCEA\nRoaming mascot characters\nFree showings of the short film “Olaf’s Frozen Adventure” at 6 p.m.\, 6:40 p.m. and 7:20 p.m. at the Varsity Theatre\, sponsored by Valley Clean Energy and the Varsity Theatre\nSinging by the “Grace Valley Carolers” in front of the Varsity Theatre\nMusic by the quartet “All About Trombones” on the patio of the Hunt Boyer Mansion\n\n 
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/davis-candlelight-parade-tree-lighting-and-winter-wonderland/
LOCATION:Davis Food Co-op\, 620 G Street\, Davis\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/639294048196400000.png
END:VEVENT
